<title>SINGAPORE: Winfoong buys more Hong Fok.</title>
<headline>Winfoong buys more Hong Fok.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hong Kong's Winfoong Holding Ltd has bought more Hong Fok Corporation shares, a Hong Fok statement said on Thursday.</p>
<p>In a declaration to the Stock Exchange of Singapore, Hong Fok said Winfoong bought 452,000 shares in the open market at an average price of Singapore $2.615 on April 15, 1997.</p>
<p>After the purchase, Winfoong holds 7.06 million shares or 5.18 percent of Hong Fok.</p>
<p>- Singapore (65-8703080)</p>
</text>
